  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a comal over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cod fish pieces and cook until they are browned on all sides.",
    "Add the red chilli powder, cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper and stir well.",
    "Add the water and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the tagine for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh parsley or cilantro."
